# Where the dashboard proxies its /api/* requests. Point this at a running
# EvalOps FastAPI server. No secrets belong in this file.
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# --- API authentication (Phase 10, CP 10.5) ---
# Only needed when the target API has EVALOPS_API_KEY set (see the root
# .env.example). Read *only* by the server-side proxy
# (src/app/api/[...path]/route.ts) and attached as `Authorization: Bearer
# <key>` on the outgoing request to FastAPI -- it never reaches the browser or
# any client bundle. Must be a plain server env var, never NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
EVALOPS_API_KEY=
